This dataset contains 21 subjects (4 sessions), and the resulting template sub-BaBa21, and probabilistic atlas (TPM WM,GM,CSF) . The T1w and T2w anatomical volumes and manual segmentations (WM,GM,CSF) of a single subject (sub-Prune) are published without embargo. Other twenty subjects can be retrieved on request from the authors and will be published in a next version.